      *                                                                 00040000
      * Copy-area R791ERRX.                                             00050000
      *                                                                 00060000
      * This copy area contains several data items defined as external. 00070000
      * These items can be accessed by any program in the logical unit  00080000
      * of work, by specifying "Copy R791ERRX." in Working-Storage.     00090000
      *                                                                 00100000
      * If implementing new fields, do so by adding the fields at the   00110000
      * bottom, just in front of the filler.                            00120000
      * Also, reduce the filler, according to the length of the new     00130000
      * fields.                                                         00140000
      *                                                                 00150000
      *################################################################*00160000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00170000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00180000
      *070215!SAS! Copied new version from SEB project.          !    !         
      *      !   ! containing chainges by HLR 061030.            !    !         
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00180000
      *061030!HLR! Implemented R791ERRX-Dflt-Language-Code as    !    !         
      *      !   ! default language. The priority will now be:   !    !         
      *      !   ! 1: R791ERR0-In-Language-Code                  !    !         
      *      !   ! 2: R791ERRX-Dflt-Language-Code                !    !         
      *      !   ! 3: Language code from database                !    !         
      *      !   ! 4: Hardcoded value 'NOB'                      !    !         
      *100200!HLR! New copy area                                 !LL80! 00190000
      *################################################################*00200000
